Hello, children of the night🩸!
Updated the demo not too long ago. Now you can play The Hungry Town in Chinese and Japanese languages. I also worked on the save system, now you can save at any time. 
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44305075/1fdf4eca24c629882ca21fdf9e8d6e316cce8265.png
Full list of updates DEMO V.1D:

 Ability to save from the game menu at any time;
 Flexible sound and text settings: adjust the speed of dialogs, music volume and voiceovers;
 Improved character movement animation: simulated walking instead of just moving sprites;
 Updated interface of dialogs and in-game smartphone, which became more intuitive and functional;
 Added support for Chinese and Japanese languages;
 Improved backgrounds of city locations;
 Fixed minor bugs for more comfortable passing.

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44305075/c6f0abf22908b2cc5127c682cab8d29fd2d5c7e9.jpg
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44305075/1fdf4eca24c629882ca21fdf9e8d6e316cce8265.png

Try out the new demo: PLAY!

And add The Hungry Town to your wishlist:

https://store.steampowered.com/app/2481160/
Alexey Osh from Kick Punch Games 😎

Although this festival is more for release games and discounts, and also you can participate with a demo or just a page.  

For Steam Scream, I have prepared a new version of The Hungry Town demo, in which I fixed some bugs and finalized various details..

What exactly added and fixed⚙️:

 Refined a few artefacts;
 Fixed inconsistencies in the text;
 Removed errors in English localization;
 Added volume settings, separately for music and dialog;
 Added text speed setting;
 Fixed a couple of bugs. One critical one that broke saves, but it seemed to get only me🤫.


https://store.steampowered.com/app/3276460/The_Hungry_Town_Demo/
